 "template": "In the Odoo Sales app, create a new quotation (Sales Orders > Quotations > New) for the customer '{{v1}}' (choose them from the autocomplete dropdown - typing alone does not count). Add exactly ONE order line: pick any product from the product catalogue via the order-line product autocomplete dropdown, with quantity 3. Let Odoo fill in the unit price automatically from the product. Save the quotation. Then report: (a) the exact product name you chose, (b) the unit price Odoo filled in on the line, and (c) the Untaxed Amount the app computes in the quotation totals. Do not confirm the quotation yet. Note: this Odoo app long-polls and is never network-idle - wait for concrete page state (e.g. the totals updating or the saved form), never for network idle.",
